{"4252550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ENDTIMES", "steam_appid": 4252550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERVIEW:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A LINEAR SCI-FI HORROR FIRST PERSON SHOOTER WHERE YOU FIGHT YOUR WAY THROUGH AN ALIEN PLANET UNCOVERING SECRETS AS YOU EXPLORE AND DESTROY EVERYTHING IN YOUR PATH.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Lore Rich Locations, Enemies, Story, &amp; Universe </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Stakes Linear Horror Action Sci-Fi Story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3~ Hour Long Campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic Action-Packed Cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge Arsenal of Guns &amp; Vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack with Licensed Music by Multiple Artists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Sky, Weather, &amp; Fog with Volumetric Clouds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Dismemberment &amp; Gore System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY SUMMARY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IN A COLD WAR BETWEEN ALIENS AND HUMANS AFTER DECADES OF FIGHTING, YOU HAVE BEEN TASKED WITH FINDING OUT WHAT THEY HAVE BEEN HIDING AND FIGHTING SO HARD TO PROTECT. DISCOVER THE DARK SECRETS THAT LIE UNDERNEATH BILLIONS OF YEARS OF DUST AND DIRT AND MAKE IT OUT ALIVE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No AI Used In Development/Marketing:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used in any part of the development/marketing of the game by me or any team members. Everything that goes into the game that was made by somebody else is checked by me to make sure its 100% made by a real person every step of the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIS GAME IS CURRENTLY IN ACTIVE/EARLY DEVELOPMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IF WANT TO SHARE YOUR IDEAS, GIVE FEEDBACK, OR JOIN THE TEAM CONTACT ME THROUGH MY WEBSITE OR DISCORD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERVIEW:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A LINEAR SCI-FI HORROR FIRST PERSON SHOOTER WHERE YOU FIGHT YOUR WAY THROUGH AN ALIEN PLANET UNCOVERING SECRETS AS YOU EXPLORE AND DESTROY EVERYTHING IN YOUR PATH.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Lore Rich Locations, Enemies, Story, &amp; Universe </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Stakes Linear Horror Action Sci-Fi Story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3~ Hour Long Campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic Action-Packed Cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge Arsenal of Guns &amp; Vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack with Licensed Music by Multiple Artists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Sky, Weather, &amp; Fog with Volumetric Clouds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Dismemberment &amp; Gore System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY SUMMARY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IN A COLD WAR BETWEEN ALIENS AND HUMANS AFTER DECADES OF FIGHTING, YOU HAVE BEEN TASKED WITH FINDING OUT WHAT THEY HAVE BEEN HIDING AND FIGHTING SO HARD TO PROTECT. DISCOVER THE DARK SECRETS THAT LIE UNDERNEATH BILLIONS OF YEARS OF DUST AND DIRT AND MAKE IT OUT ALIVE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><